    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, in relation to directing the office of\nrenewable energy siting, in consultation with the public service commission,\nto create a statewide map of all proposed major renewable energy facility\nsites and an informational tab that calculates regional impacts of such\nproposed sites",
